The '''HHMods Recipes''' plugin (part of the [[HHMods]] suite) adds three community recipes to the base game's [[Crafting|workbench system]].

== Recipes added ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Recipe !! Workbench !! Notes
|-
| '''Water''' || [[Campfire]] || Player-craftable water. Adds a first-tier source that doesn't require looting.
|-
| '''Gunpowder''' || [[Biochemical Workbench]] || Enables firearm ammunition without waiting on late-tier salvage.
|-
| '''Steel Chest''' || [[Furnace]] || A 24-slot storage container, larger than the base Wooden (8) and Iron (16) chests.
|}

== Technical ==

Each recipe is registered at plugin startup via <code>HHMods.Core.RecipeRegistry.Register</code>. This appends a <code>PerIconData</code> to the correct <code>CraftItemData.perIconData</code> for the target <code>WorkbenchType</code>. Idempotent across scene reloads.

